summary:
The checkout service returns an internal error when placing this order after the discount is applied. The accepted discount makes the displayed total negative, and the order cannot be completed.
Fix checkout so an order using the accepted WELCOME20 code completes successfully, or prevent the code from being accepted when it would make the order total invalid.
evidence: http_error_response: POST http://localhost:3100/api/checkout -> 500 body: {"error":"Internal error"}
evidence: console_error: [checkout] failed: Internal error
evidence: http_error_response: POST http://localhost:3100/api/checkout -> 500 body: {"error":"Internal error"}

